OL,3,GNEWSAGrand Theft Auto boss denies
OL,4,Atrying to keep tabs on union membership
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boss of gaming giant Rockstar - the
OL,7,Ffirm behind Grand Theft Auto - has said
OL,8,Fclaims the firm tried to keep tabs on
OL,9,Funion membership are "completely
OL,10,Funtrue"
OL,12,FRob Scampinato, vice president of HR,
OL,13,Ftold an employment tribunal they tried
OL,14,Fto "keep abreast" of collective
OL,15,Fgrievances, but were not trying to root
OL,16,Fout trade union activists.
OL,18,FThe case centres on the dismissal
OL,19,Falmost a year ago of 34 workers, most
OL,20,Fof them based in Edinburgh, who claim
OL,21,Fthey were unfairly sacked for trade
OL,22,Funion activity.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
