OL,3,GNEWSAGrand Theft Auto boss denies
OL,4,Atrying to keep tabs on union membership
OL,5,
OL,6,FRockstar, which is due to launch Grand
OL,7,FTheft Auto 6 next month, maintains they
OL,8,Fwere dismissed for "sharing
OL,9,Fconfidential company information" in an
OL,10,Finsecure private online forum.
